{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing ResNet50 with ViT as the image encoder in a scvi_n200-based multimodal setup using transformer aggregation and weighted fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.725 and F1 of 0.685 suggest ViT may improve performance compared to prior ResNet50-based configurations. Uncertainty remains about other contributing factors or alternative configurations that could further influence results."
}

